```

**`AppModule.kt`** — replaced the simple `.build()` call with a callback-aware builder that seeds presets on first DB creation:

```31:44:app/src/main/java/com/musicplayer/di/AppModule.kt
    fun provideAppDatabase(@ApplicationContext context: Context): AppDatabase {
        var instance: AppDatabase? = null
        val callback = object : RoomDatabase.Callback() {
