```

To verify on device: run the app on the S24 Ultra, then in Logcat filter by tag `MusicPlayerDB` — you should see `Track count in DB: 0` (no music scanned yet, that's Session 3). The EQ presets are seeded silently on first launch and can be confirmed in Session 7 when the EQ screen is built.
